WEBVTT

00:13:30.638 --> 00:13:32.453
It doesn't have to happen to us.

00:13:32.477 --> 00:13:35.635
The difference
between the dinosaurs and us

00:13:35.659 --> 00:13:37.774
is that we have a space program

00:13:37.798 --> 00:13:39.520
and we can vote,

00:13:39.544 --> 00:13:41.876
and so we can change our future.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.537
(Laughter)

00:13:43.561 --> 00:13:45.653
We have the ability to change our future.

00:13:45.677 --> 00:13:47.654
Sixty-five million years from now,

00:13:47.678 --> 00:13:51.582
we don't have to have our bones
collecting dust in a museum.

00:13:51.606 --> 00:13:52.774
Thank you very much.

00:13:52.798 --> 00:13:55.804
(Applause)